      <h1>Who Was Satoshi Nakamoto?</h1>
      <p class="msc-learn-page__deck">Satoshi Nakamoto is the pseudonymous creator, or group of creators, who published the Bitcoin white paper and released the first software. The public record documents Satoshi&#39;s work and early collaboration in detail, but it does not establish a verified real-world identity.</p>
      <ul class="msc-learn-page-meta"><li>Foundations</li><li>Surface</li><li>History</li><li>8 to 9 minutes</li><li>Reviewed 2026-07-15</li></ul>
      <p class="msc-learn-preview-note">Preview only. Publication records and confirmed URLs do not exist; all navigation remains inactive.</p>
